<section class="cart-band" id="process">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head drop">
      <div>
        <p class="sec-kicker">How it works</p>
        <h2 class="sec-title">Call. Book. Water's on the way.</h2>
        <p class="sec-sub">Straightforward from the first call — quick, reliable, trusted.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="steps">
      <div class="step drop"><p class="step-n">01</p><h3>Call or message</h3><p>Tell us what you need — a fill, a clean, an install or filtration.</p></div>
      <div class="step drop"><p class="step-n">02</p><h3>Get a straight price</h3><p>Clear pricing on the spot — no surprises, no hidden extras.</p></div>
      <div class="step drop"><p class="step-n">03</p><h3>Book your slot</h3><p>Pick a time that suits — we turn up when we say we will.</p></div>
      <div class="step drop"><p class="step-n">04</p><h3>We deliver &amp; do the job</h3><p>Water carted and pumped in, tank cleaned, or system installed — properly.</p></div>
